        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>葛雷制与昆西教学法 手写笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #e8e8e8;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .device {\n    max-width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f7f7f7;\n  }\n  /* ---- status bar ---- */\n  .statusbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding: 4px 10px 2px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-family: -apple-system, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .statusbar .left { white-space: nowrap; }\n  .statusbar .right { white-space: nowrap; }\n  /* ---- toolbars ---- */\n  .toolbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    font-family: -apple-system, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  .toolbar .icons { display: flex; gap: 18px; }\n  .toolbar .spacer { flex: 1; }\n  .toolbar .title { font-size: 14px; color: #222; }\n  .icon-ph {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 16px; height: 16px;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n  }\n  .dot {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 15px; height: 15px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n  .toolbar2 { gap: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }\n  /* ---- note page ---- */\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(\n        to bottom,\n        #fdfdf6 0px, #fdfdf6 21px,\n        #cfe3ee 21px, #cfe3ee 22px\n      );\n    padding: 10px 14px 18px 14px;\n    line-height: 22px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n  .page::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 26px;\n    width: 1px;\n    background: #f0b9c3;\n  }\n  h2.sec {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 6px 0 2px 0;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .green { color: #1a8a3a; }\n  .blue  { color: #1a5fd0; }\n  .lightblue { color: #2b9bd4; }\n  .red   { color: #d32f2f; }\n  .pink  { color: #e0409a; }\n  .purple{ color: #8e44ad; }\n  .orange{ color: #e67e22; }\n  .brown { color: #8d6e63; }\n  .note-small { font-size: 11px; }\n  .paren-note { font-size: 11px; }\n  .circled {\n    border: 1.5px solid #e0409a;\n    border-radius: 40% 45% 42% 48%;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    line-height: 18px;\n  }\n  .circled-blue {\n    border: 1.5px solid #1a5fd0;\n    border-radius: 45% 40% 48% 42%;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    line-height: 18px;\n  }\n  .boxed-pink {\n    border: 1.5px solid #e0409a;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    line-height: 18px;\n  }\n  .oval-note {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.5px solid #e0409a;\n    border-radius: 50%/60%;\n    padding: 1px 10px;\n    line-height: 18px;\n  }\n  .indent { display: block; text-indent: 2em; }\n  .kou {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #f4a6c0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin: 14px 0 10px;\n  }\n  .row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; }\n  .heading-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }\n  .center-note { text-align: center; display: block; }\n  .right-note { display: block; text-align: right; }\n  p { margin: 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"device\">\n\n  <div class=\"statusbar\">\n    <div class=\"left\">上午9:10　6月27日周日</div>\n    <div class=\"right\">◦◦◦ ▮ 91% ▬</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"toolbar toolbar1\">\n    <div class=\"icons\">\n      <span>&lt;</span>\n      <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n      <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n      <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n      <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n      <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n    <div class=\"title\">333 ˅</div>\n    <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n    <div class=\"icons\">\n      <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n      <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n      <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n      <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"toolbar toolbar2\">\n    <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    <span class=\"icon-ph\"></span>\n    <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#f5d94a;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#e0409a;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3aa757;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#2b7fd4;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#111;\"></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page\">\n\n    <!-- 葛雷制 -->\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n      <span class=\"green\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\">葛雷制</span>\n      <span class=\"pink paren-note\">（没考过）</span>\n      <span class=\"blue kou\">口诀：捡内衣（简介、内容、意义）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p><span class=\"red\">简介：</span>葛雷制又称“双轨制”、“二部制”。是美国教育家沃特在葛雷市所推行的一种教学制度。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"right-note\"><span class=\"lightblue\">&lt;学校分工向教立体”&gt;</span></p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"red\">内容：</span>以社威的教育思想为理论基础，将学校分为四个方面：<span class=\"green\">工厂和商店</span>、<span class=\"green\">教室</span>、<span class=\"green\">礼堂</span>、<span class=\"green\">体育运动场</span>；<span class=\"lightblue\">课程</span>也分为四个方面：家政和<span class=\"lightblue\">工艺</span>、<span class=\"green\">团体</span>活动、<span class=\"lightblue\">体育游戏</span>、<span class=\"green\">学术</span>。为了减少经费，将全校学生一分为二，一部分在教室上课，一部分在其他场所活动，上下午对调。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"center-note\"><span class=\"purple\">&lt;课程分为“加工团体空”&gt;</span></p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"red\">意义：</span>葛雷制是美国进步主义教育运动中最卓越的表现，既有利于保持儿童的兴趣，也有着经济高效的管理方式</p>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\">@小红书：起风了的风景</div>\n\n    <!-- 昆西教学法（考过简答） -->\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n      <span class=\"green\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\">昆西教学法</span>\n      <span class=\"pink paren-note\">（考过简答）</span>\n      <span class=\"blue kou\">口诀：含泪评价（含义、内容、评价）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p><span class=\"red\">一、含义：</span>昆西教学法由美国进步主义教育家帕克创办的一种教学方法。</p>\n    <p><span class=\"red\">二、内容：</span><span class=\"circled-blue\">儿童中心重学校，学实联系培创造</span></p>\n    <p>1、强调儿童应处于学校教育的中心。认为儿童具有内在的能力，能自发地学习。</p>\n    <p>2、<span class=\"green\">重视学校的社会功能</span>。强调学校应成为理想的家庭、完善的社会和民主政治的雏形。</p>\n    <p>3、<span class=\"green\">学校课程</span>与<span class=\"green\">实际生活相联系</span>。这样不仅可以唤起儿童学习的意愿，而且能摒弃无意义的形式训练。并把各门学科统一起来，获得整体知识。</p>\n    <p>4、强调<span class=\"green\">培养儿童的自我探索和创造精神</span>。帕克认为教师的作用是指导学生发现真理，使学生养成习惯来使用真理。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <span class=\"red\">三、评价：</span>\n      <span class=\"pink\" style=\"margin-left:14px;\">（调动儿童积极，忽视系统学习）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>1、昆西教学法有利于调动儿童学习的<span class=\"green\">积极性和主动性</span>，满足学生的兴趣与需要，使儿童成为学习的主人</p>\n    <p>2、昆西教学法过分强调儿童的个性，忽视教师的作用，<span class=\"boxed-pink\">忽略了系统知识的学习</span>，导致教学质量降低</p>\n\n    <!-- 昆西教学法（考过名词解释） -->\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n      <span class=\"green\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\">昆西教学法</span>\n      <span class=\"pink paren-note\">（考过名词解释）</span>\n      <span class=\"blue kou\">口诀：含泪评价（含义、内容、评价）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p><span class=\"red\">含义：</span>昆西教学法由美国进步主义教育家帕克创办的一种教学方法。</p>\n    <p><span class=\"red\">内容：</span>强调儿童应处于学校教育的中心；重视学校的社会功能，强调学校应成为理想的家庭、完善的社会和民主政治的雏形；学校课程与实际生活<span class=\"green\">相联系</span>；强调培养儿童的自我探索和<span class=\"green\">创造精神</span>　<span class=\"circled-blue\">儿童中心重学校，学实联系培创造</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"red\">评价：</span>昆西教学法有利于调动儿童学习的积极性和主动性，但过分强调儿童的个性，<span class=\"boxed-pink\">忽略了系统知识的学习</span>，导致教学质量降低　<span class=\"pink\">（调动儿童积极，忽视系统学习）</span></p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
